# A blocker removed in response is not counted when Márton’s block trigger resolves (CR 506.4, 608.2h).
[Bot1 Deck]
Márton Stromgald
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter x3
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears x2
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Márton Stromgald.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
